# Environment files; keep non-secret templates accessible
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
!**/.env.template

# Private keys and credential files
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials.json
**/credentials.*.json
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*serviceAccount*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json

# Other potentially sensitive configuration files
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc